{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-val-by-kasco","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"val-by-kasco-properties-al-jaddaf","about":"Val by Kasco in Al Jaddaf by Kasco Properties is an exclusive new residential development located at the vibrant Al Jaddaf Waterfront. This project is designed to cater to those who seek a blend of contemporary elegance and urban convenience. With a range of thoughtfully designed studios, 1-bedroom, and 2-bedroom apartments, Val Residences offers a cool, crisp ambiance, creating an oasis of calm amidst the bustling city life. Each unit is meticulously crafted to radiate a sense of luxury and tranquility, making it the perfect retreat for the modern socialite.Beyond its stylish interiors, Val Residences provides a selection of top-tier amenities, including a resort-style swimming pool, yoga area, sauna, and state-of-the-art gym. Residents will also enjoy seamless connectivity to Dubai’s key landmarks, such as Downtown Dubai, Dubai International Airport, and Palm Jumeirah. The payment plan for Val Residences is designed to be simple and flexible, making it easier for buyers to invest. 40% of the payment is made during the construction phase, allowing you to spread out the cost as the project progresses. The remaining 60% is paid upon completion, giving you time to plan your finances.","price":null,"title":"Val by Kasco","bitrix":{"id":1039,"pf_id":"are.2.14391","source":null,"project_id":"Val by Kasco","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Val Residences","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Kasco Developments","project_location":"Al Jaddaf"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Val_by_Kasco_in_Al_Jaddaf_by_Kasco_Properties_38067c5de4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Val_by_Kasco_in_Al_Jaddaf_by_Kasco_Properties_38067c5de4.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2262264,"lng":55.